00:03:44.148 --> 00:03:45.836
- Gordon Ramsey

00:03:45.836 --> 00:03:46.969
- Ooh.

00:03:46.969 --> 00:03:49.616
- I can see it though,
Gordon is like the master.

00:03:49.616 --> 00:03:51.126
- I think this is diner quality.

00:03:51.126 --> 00:03:52.620
