00:03:59.592 --> 00:04:00.686
- Oh Chrissy!

00:04:00.686 --> 00:04:01.712
- Oh my god!

00:04:01.712 --> 00:04:03.185
- Oh no, Chrissy Teigan.

00:04:03.185 --> 00:04:04.213
- The queen, okay, I can see that.

00:04:04.213 --> 00:04:05.046
